  "pitch_title": "Tipperary: The End of Tip Anxiety",
  "executive_summary": "Tipperary is a mobile application that leverages aggregated user data to provide real-time, location-specific average tip percentages for any restaurant. We eliminate the social friction and financial uncertainty of tipping by giving diners confidence in their contribution, while helping service staff earn fair compensation based on local norms.",
  "problem_statement": {
