    "core_functionality": "Users input their bill amount and select the restaurant from our database. The app instantly displays the calculated average tip percentage for that establishment, adjusted for recent user feedback on service quality.",
    "key_features": [
      "Real-time Average Tip Calculator: Displays the median tip % for the last 50 transactions at the selected venue.",
      "Service Quality Modifier: Users rate service post-meal; the algorithm adjusts future recommendations based on positive/negative trends.",
      "Local Norm Insights: Shows how the current restaurant's tipping culture compares to the city average.",
      "Split Bill Integration: Automatically calculates individual tip amounts for group dining scenarios."
    ]
  },
  "market_opportunity": {
    "target_audience": "Millennials and Gen Z diners who value convenience and social proof, as well as tourists unfamiliar with local customs.",
