**Highlights:** a Victorian "broadside" masthead with letter-by-letter type strike and a rotating approval stamp, a running ticker of all 25 Bills, an index with dotted leaders, 25 fully-rhymed AABBA limericks (one with the **economist**, one with **Jurgen**), marginalia under each verse, a "Draw a Bill" lottery with a decelerating slot, a draining ink gauge, a clickable anapest scansion demo, and an errata page that dutifully explains the lowercase *bill*. All motion respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.

