    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ ERRATA ============ -->
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="sec-orn"><i>❦</i></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title"><span class="mask"><span class="mask-in">Addendum &amp; Errata</span></span></h2>
  </section>
  <div class="errata-list">
    <p class="err"><b>No. 2</b><span><em>jurgen</em> appears, in the second printing, in lowercase. The gentleman has asked us to correct it. We have not, and we shall not.</span></p>
    <p class="err"><b>No. 9</b><span>The penguin’s tip is, in fact, recorded in the ferry log, page forty-one. The berry has been confirmed. The penguin has been apologised to.</span></p>
    <p class="err"><b>No. 14</b><span>The bridge still stands. The captain’s cry was verified by two witnesses and one rather unimpressed gull.</span></p>
    <p class="err"><b>No. 25</b><span>The ribbon has been returned, teeth-mark and all, to the box. The box was, at the last, returned to the box.</span></p>
    <p class="err"><b>A note on “bill”</b><span>A <em>bill</em> (the kind with a small b) is a document; a <em>Bill</em> (the kind with a capital) is a gentleman. This book concerns, so far as the printer can tell, only the latter.</span></p>
  </div>

